---
description: Generate consistent world pixel art with isolated reference images and verified runtime assets
globs: native/client/assets/raster/**,native/tools/raster/**,native/client/raster_art.hpp
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `native/client/assets/raster/AGENTS.md` and `PROMPTING.md` before
generating world art; use `RESEARCH.md` for actual creator prompts and results.
Use an accepted identity reference for one character/direction at a time.
Try a demonstrated motion-sheet prompt or individual frames as appropriate;
validate and assemble production atlases in code. Preserve natural material colors;
the game name does not prescribe green oxidation. Inspect Pixel Respecter
outputs and actual gameplay before accepting an asset or animation.
